# Amalia Benavides Aguirre: "Then destroy all other creatures if its power is EXACTLY 20." The same build-up as the scenario where
# it is 20 (Wrecking Ball Arm 7/7 base, two Ruins counters, one counter from the turn-1 explore, Legion Leadership doubling 10 to
# 20 on turn 9) - but this time the top card at the last explore is a nonland Mana Vault, so Amalia gets a +1/+1 counter first
# and her power when the check is made is 21. Nothing is destroyed: both of Bot2's Ornithopters and Bot1's own survive (the
# last explore's counter is applied before the check, CR 701.44a, and 21 is not 20). Bot1 leaves Mana Vault on top.

